%li.jpost#engineer
  .title.expandable
    %a.more-details
      %i.icon-plus
    %h3.name Software Engineer

  .details
    .details-container
      %p.location
        San Francisco, CA United States or Singapore

      %p Action.IO software engineers are responsible for driving the user experience and performance of our web and desktop applications.
      %p We’re looking for motivated, independent thinkers who employ creative, scalable and performant solutions.

      %h4 Responsibilities
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Build new features in Rails, Node.js, Coffeescript and Ember.js
          %li Benchmark app performance and design scalable and performant systems and APIs

      %h4 Technologies
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Ruby / Python / Node.JS / Go
          %li Redis / PostgreSQL
          %li Websockets / Socket.IO
          %li Experience with AWS
          %li Rabbitmq / Activemq

      %h4 Requirements
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li A passion for cloud computing and optimization
          %li Obsessive attention to detail
          %li Risk taker, not afraid to break things to push the envelope of what’s possible
          %li Degree in Computer Science or related technical field

      .details-actions
        %p
          = mail_to 'jobs@action.io', 'Apply for this Job', encode: 'javascript', class: "btn btn-success"
